* ''The seam testimony stays testimony'' (controller and reserve seat, 2026-11-07). Opus and Sol leads cured in single steps three cross-package seams where Terra leads stalled; the observation stays confounded by second attempts, by the broken test door Terra worked behind, and by labelling a lane a seam after it stalls. Lease-end slice 2 goes to Terra first through the fixed door as a lead seat once the pool reads under the lead ceiling (a build seat's conductor, committing each diff, would confound the measure), recording steps to green and brief size, before any ruling moves.

